-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/7cd02f0eb508fe4183e8a7cbc6ff4948.poster.avif?t=1778084209\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/7cd02f0eb508fe4183e8a7cbc6ff4948.webm?t=1778084209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/7cd02f0eb508fe4183e8a7cbc6ff4948.mp4?t=1778084209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >想稍事休息？来温暖舒适的雪居城歇歇脚吧。幸存者们齐聚在巨型热冰——“光之结晶”周围，用它的能量取暖。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >随着你在征程中不断取得进展，雪居城的规模也会不断扩大，更可建造宠物商店、发明者小屋等建筑！新区域会解锁有趣又实用的道具供你在冒险中使用，还会为你带来新的卡牌、部落、外观、游戏挑战，以及各种遭遇事件！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/d48a9c4d08462ab3fb5bcbb97b446b87.poster.avif?t=1778084209\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/d48a9c4d08462ab3fb5bcbb97b446b87.webm?t=1778084209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/d48a9c4d08462ab3fb5bcbb97b446b87.mp4?t=1778084209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >就算已经战胜寒霜，但《雪居之地》的丰富内容也不会就此结束！快来参与每日征程与每日挑战，磨炼技艺、挑战最高分吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1811990/extras/84bedc610b6f88adcc8e4d59902f4b65.webp?t=1778084209\" width=616 height=44 /></span><span class=\"bb_im